WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.747
Nagata's conjecture from nineteen fifty-nine.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.420
Through ten or more general points, multiplicities

3
00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:07.540
must total less than d root r.

4
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.315
Move the points into a pattern, then

5
00:00:11.315 --> 00:00:13.043
